{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"One sunny morning, two friends packed food for a picnic.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.6],[0.67,1.14],[1.16,1.36],[1.46,1.87],[1.94,2.25],[2.32,2.6],[2.66,2.81],[2.87,2.91],[2.98,3.85]]},{"text":"They put two apples into the basket.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.5],[0.55,0.74],[0.84,1.29],[1.36,1.54],[1.61,1.68],[1.74,2.69]]},{"text":"Then they added one more apple.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.46],[0.53,0.86],[0.94,1.14],[1.2,1.43],[1.5,2.28]]},{"text":"Now they had more apples than before.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.48],[0.55,0.71],[0.8,1.08],[1.14,1.56],[1.6,1.75],[1.81,2.69]]},{"text":"They counted carefully: one, two, three apples in all.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.72],[0.79,1.47],[1.68,2.02],[2.07,2.4],[2.45,2.73],[2.79,3.18],[3.24,3.33],[3.41,4.04]]},{"text":"Later, they had three sandwiches.","words":[[0,0.6],[0.78,0.97],[1.03,1.2],[1.28,1.61],[1.67,2.83]]},{"text":"Their friend arrived and brought two more sandwiches.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.37,0.66],[0.72,1.2],[1.25,1.37],[1.43,1.79],[1.83,2.01],[2.09,2.33],[2.4,3.62]]},{"text":"They put all the sandwiches together.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.35,0.59],[0.66,0.86],[0.92,0.99],[1.04,1.6],[1.66,2.55]]},{"text":"Now there were more sandwiches than before!","words":[[0,0.28],[0.35,0.53],[0.58,0.77],[0.84,1.1],[1.17,1.86],[1.9,2.06],[2.13,3.06]]},{"text":"They learned something important: when we put things together, we get more in all.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.65],[0.7,1.08],[1.15,2.07],[2.31,2.53],[2.58,2.66],[2.74,2.97],[3.04,3.33],[3.39,4.05],[4.26,4.4],[4.47,4.64],[4.75,5.08],[5.14,5.25],[5.35,6.13]]}]}